# A value every thread reads alike, each of whose definitions is an
# unguarded shl by a constant k or and with a constant whose low k bits
# are 0, reads as 2^k times its floor over 2^k, so its or with bits
# below 2^k is an add: 512·⌊u/128⌋ prints as 4·u. A guarded shl keeps
# another value where its guard is false, and a count in a register may
# be smaller: the or is unknown. A count is its unsigned 32-bit value:
# 0x100000007 shifts by 7. A floor by a divisor the 2^k neither divides
# nor is divided by is refused, where uniform(…) alone read
# ⌊(3·%tid.x + b)/3⌋.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/uniform_aligned.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store [4·%tid.x + 4·uniform(%r3@$L__BB0_1) + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store addr ? (or whose sides may both set bit 0){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store addr ? (or whose sides may both set bit 0){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store [4·%tid.x + 4·uniform(%r6@118) + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store [4·%tid.x + 4·uniform(%r3@$L__BB4_1) + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store [16·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 16 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store addr ? (depends on ⌊uniform(%r3@$L__BB6_1)/128⌋, in a division){{$}}
